  "prompt": "Compare first-touch and last-touch attribution for the visitors who signed up. Use each visitor's sessions that started at or before their signup_ts; session_start and signup_ts hold UTC instants. The first touch is the earliest of those sessions and the last touch the latest. When two sessions of a visitor tie on session_start, the one with the lower session_id counts, for the first touch and for the last touch. For each utm_source, count the visitors whose first touch came from it and the visitors whose last touch came from it; a session with a missing utm_source counts in a row of its own, with utm_source missing. Return three columns, in this order: utm_source, first_touch and last_touch. Return one row for each utm_source of some first or last touch. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "utm_source",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "first_touch",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "last_touch",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
    "grain": null
  },
